# Warehouse floor UI

## Components

- **`ScanInput`:** USB HID scanners (keyboard wedge, submit on Enter) and optional camera mode; must not drop scans on network errors — allow retry and show errors clearly.
- **`NumericKeypad`:** large touch targets; PIN entry uses **non-decimal** mode and masked display where implemented.

## Layout

- **`WarehouseShell`:** header, collapsible sidebar, footer — keep full-screen, legible typography.
- Target **minimum width ~375px** for floor views.

## Stack

- Floor screens are **not** the place for heavy shadcn usage; keep custom components simple and durable on rugged/tablet devices. Dashboard patterns (`GenericTable`, etc.) belong on `/dashboard`, not necessarily here.
